        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Emma!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "'Stop it! I mean it! And return those stolen Pok\u00e9mon!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Well, if that don't take the biscuit! This is down to you, Emma."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Yer just couldn't be bothered with us no more."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "What's the point of us if yer don't show up?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Yer the boss of this gang! Did yer think how we missed yer?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Goin' off with this bad news and never a thought to yer old mates. Thanks for nothin'!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "Oh, put a sock in it! I said up front--don't count me in."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "You went ahead and called me boss without even asking what I wanted."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "I decide for myself! Now, back off before I really lose it!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "N-no! N-n-not that! We got it, boss! We got it!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Yer don't have to be the boss!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "We've just been missing yer since yer stopped comin' round!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Here, we'll give yer back the Pok\u00e9 Balls, so forgive us--aight?!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "Right. Well, enough said. I'll let it go this time, but..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "You need to say sorry to the lady you stole from. And to Mr. Looker, too!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page18');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page18",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Yes, ma'am! I will! I'm awful sorry for nickin' the Pok\u00e9mon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page19');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page19",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Yer got me bang to rights. Forgive me?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page20');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page20",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Ahem. Of course."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page21');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page21",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "The Pok\u00e9mon shall be safely restored, so let's call it water under the bridge."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page22');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page22",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "A-a-a-a-and...case closed!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page23');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page23",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'Cheers, ' + q.player.username + ', Emma! Lets head back to the Looker Bureau!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page24');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page24",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "OK!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page25');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page25",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Oh, I forgot something... Wait. Thirty seconds!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page26');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page26",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Hey, folks!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page27');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page27",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "...Eh?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page28');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page28",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "It's your wish to be friends with Emma, is that correct?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page29');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page29",
            "speaker": "punkguy",
            "lines": [
                "Yer sussed that out, eh?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run function kalos:triggers/stopsound');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run playsound lookerssorrowfultheme record @s[tag=!RadioOff] ~ ~ ~ 1 1 1');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run scoreboard players set @s[tag=!RadioOff] MusicCooldown 133');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page30');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page30",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "When people behave with evil intentions, I cannot turn away and lightly forgive such."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page31');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page31",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Especially people who do cruel and thoughtless things."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page32');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page32",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "For example, stealing the beloved Pok\u00e9mon of other Trainers..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page33');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page33",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "However... I believe... No. Not just believe. I KNOW..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page34');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page34",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "People and Pok\u00e9mon are both capable of...evolving. And so..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page35');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page35",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "If you give your word of honor not to ever lift a hand in cruelty again,"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page36');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page36",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "then you may come by the Looker Bureau anytime to visit Emma...as her friends."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page37');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page37",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "Mr. L-L-Looker..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page38');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page38",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "Sir..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page39');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page39",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Let us now return! Back once more to the Looker Bureau!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run give @s minecraft:blindness 5 1 true');",
                            "q.run_command('tp @e[x=1124,y=104,z=2009,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] 10000000 -50000 -10000000');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run function kalos:triggers/stopsound');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run tp @s -73 101 437 143 8');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page40');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page40",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "Mr. Looker... I'm really sorry about what happened earlier..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page41');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page41",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "When that woman insulted you, I just saw red and I... I..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page42');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page42",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "If you learned something from it, that is all I need to hear, Emma."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page43');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page43",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "But that is not what concerns me now."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page44');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page44",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "Imagine how I felt to discover that you were the boss of that gang!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page45');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page45",
            "speaker": "looker",
            "lines": [
                "If you give your word of honor not to ever lift a hand in cruelty again,"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page46');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page46",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "Oh, it's just silly. I wasn't in the gang for real!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page47');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page47",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "I had a big fight with them one time, and after I took them down, they figured I was their boss."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page48');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page48",
            "speaker": "emma",
            "lines": [
                "It was all their idea, not mine!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
